State 13 conflicts: 1 shift/reduce


Grammar

    0 $accept: line $end

    1 line: /* empty */
    2     | line item

    3 item: declaration
    4     | statement

    5 declaration: INT id
    6            | FLOAT id

    7 statement: expr

    8 expr: INUM
    9     | FNUM
   10     | id
   11     | id ASSIGN expr
   12     | expr PLUS expr
   13     | expr MINUS expr
   14     | expr MUL expr
   15     | expr DIV expr
   16     | LP expr RP
   17     | MINUS expr

   18 id: ID


